E. Strike or hit a Portland Streetcar vehicle, station or shelter; or

F. Stop or cross in front of a Portland Streetcar vehicle for the purpose of stopping the vehicle or gaining passage after the vehicle has concluded boarding in any manner hang onto; or attach themself to, any exterior part of a Portland Streetcar vehicle while the vehicle is resting or in motion.

No person may:

