B. If charges are unpaid;

C. Service was turned on unlawfully; or

D. If the property is not compliant with backflow prevention requirements.

The Water Bureau is not responsible for property damage caused by a shutoff. Damage may include bursting boilers, breaking pipes or fixtures or problems arising from interruption of the water supply.

